			<div class="content" id="post-content-4846229">
									

<p>Anomalous instruction pamphlets designed to maim/kill seemingly random people across the globe&#8230; (all criticism welcome)</p>
<p><em>I moved and trimmed your thread summary, since it was taking up extra space in the main forum screen. Try to keep thread descriptions (the text in the little box under the thread title) and titles short so you don't crowd out other authors in the forum listing. ~Zyn</em></p>
<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> SCP Article</p>
<p><strong>Genre:</strong> Mystery</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> An anomalous set of pamphlets that compel the reader to do whatever the pamphlet has written on it- for example, if one said &quot;read this pamphlet over and over&quot;, the subject would be forced to read the pamphlet over and over until it is taken from them or they expire.</p>
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong> A group of researchers testing the capabilities of the SCP after MTF recovery units with memetic resistance find multiple pamphlets in seemingly random homes in urban areas such as Berlin, NYC, and London. Interviews with the owners of the homes show that they all have had attempts on their lives through anomalous means within the past three months.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>The people are administered amnestics and are put back in their homes with a Foundation agent trailing them to make sure they are not killed. The researchers begin investigations on possible reasons why the makers of the pamphlets are targeting these people. One of the D-Class testing personnel notices that the contents of the pamphlet have changed.</p>
<p>The pamphlet writes about how the hitmen attempting to kill these people know that the Foundation has acquired the pamphlets and that the hitmen will not be so careless in the future, potentially setting up an opportunity for there to be more to the story.</p>
<p>The Foundation intercepts a radio transmission detailing the failure of the pamphlets, and discussing potential plans for the future. Foundation agents find a connection between the targets of the killings: they have all been involved in numerous black-market purchases of anomalous objects.</p>
<p>The Foundation discovers the existence of a group of assassins hired by existing groups to carry out their dirty work. The group has been implicated in over 260 murders, burglaries and other crimes across the globe, starting in 2008.</p>
<p>The article ends with all the pamphlets changing to contain the message <strong>WE’LL BE WATCHING. SIGNED WITH LOVE, THE SWORD OF THE KING</strong></p>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong> The different pamphlets have different instructions tailored to the individuals who received them. Each of them seems to be designed to seriously maim or kill the person who received them. The mystery of why these people are being targeted by anomalous killers is also a good hook.</p>
<p><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> With this SCP, I am hoping to set up an opportunity for a new GOI or POI and more SCPs. All criticism is appreciated!</p>
</div>
</div>
