<p>Great criticism, as always. I was thinking of fleshing the idea out a little more, maybe making a PoI or a GoI that created these as a form of getting what they want.<br />
I was a little unclear on what 'to the researchers' meant. I wrote it as they thought it was mostly harmless to the D-Class who tested on it.</p>
